# 0m_cliff_hall: GunTurret bases u0501/u04fc, tops u0506/u04fd. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 1baa96c2,0m_cliff_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u0506 15 300
@f330 scan u0501 15 300
@f600 fsm u0501 IntoPan
@f700 fsm u0501 PanLeft
@f800 fsm u0501 PanRight
@f900 fsm u0501 AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u0501 Flinch
@f1100 fsm u0501 CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u0501 OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u0501 Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u0506 PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u0506 PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u0501 Attack
@f1600 damage u0506 5
@f1700 damage u0506 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u04fc Patrol
@f1900 statecall u04fc IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u04fc IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u04fc IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u04fc AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u04fc AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u04fc AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u04fc Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u04fc Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u04fc Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u0506
@f2200 obj u0501; obj u0506
@f2300 tp 4 60 -104
@f2900 obj u0501; obj u04fc
@f3000 kill u04fd
@f3300 objs GunTurret
